        "text": "Global Employee\nSafety Solutions"
      },
      {
        "tag": "H2",
        "text": "From everyday prevention to on-the-ground emergency response."
      },
      {
        "tag": "H2",
        "text": "Your business went global. Did your safety standards?"
      },
      {
        "tag": "H3",
        "text": "Growing global operations"
      },
      {
        "tag": "H3",
        "text": "Rising standards of care"
      },
      {
        "tag": "H3",
        "text": "Disruption and continuity"
      },
      {
        "tag": "H2",
        "text": "Skip the prep, and risks snowball."
      },
      {
        "tag": "H2",
        "text": "Can your company answer these four — today?"
      },
      {
        "tag": "H2",
        "text": "Safety isn’t just damage control. It’s business continuity."
      },
      {
        "tag": "H3",
        "text": "Identify risks and support preventive action before incidents occur."
      },
      {
        "tag": "H3",
        "text": "Support prompt, coordinated decisions and response during incidents."
      },
      {
        "tag": "H3",
        "text": "Keep operational records of prevention and response."
