        "tag": "H3",
        "text": "Everyone at the table gets a win."
      },
      {
        "tag": "H2",
        "text": "Business travellers to local staff. One standard of care."
      },
      {
        "tag": "H3",
        "text": "From routine to full-on crisis."
      },
      {
        "tag": "H2",
        "text": "WE PROTECT EVERY LIFE, EVERY DAY, EVERYWHERE."
      },
      {
        "tag": "H2",
        "text": "Defining coverage is the first step in safety."
      },
      {
        "tag": "H2",
        "text": "Anticipating risk.\nGuiding decisions.\nResponding locally.\nSupporting recovery."
      },
      {
        "tag": "H2",
        "text": "Middle East escalation: four family members brought safely home."
      },
      {
        "tag": "H2",
        "text": "Reach out. The response starts right then."
      },
      {
        "tag": "H2",
        "text": "Not rivals. Teammates."
